@startuml one_sided_operations
!theme plain
title URMA 单边操作 (One-sided Operations)

box "Host A (Initiator)" #DDFFDD
    participant "Application" as App_A
    participant "JFS" as JFS_A
    participant "Segment A\n(Local Buffer)" as SEG_A
end box

participant "Network\n(UDMA)" as Network

box "Host B (Target)" #FFDDDD
    participant "Segment B\n(Remote Buffer)" as SEG_B
    participant "JFR" as JFR_B
    participant "Application" as App_B
end box

note over App_B, SEG_B
    远端应用无需感知单边操作
    硬件直接 DMA 读写内存
end note

== Write 操作 (本地 → 远端) ==
App_A -> JFS_A : urma_post_write()\nsrc=local_buf, dst=remote_seg
activate JFS_A
JFS_A -> SEG_A : Read local data
SEG_A --> JFS_A : 
JFS_A -> Network : DMA Write Request\n(with remote UBVA)
Network -> SEG_B : DMA Write\n(直接写入远端内存)
SEG_B --> Network : ACK
Network --> JFS_A : Completion
JFS_A --> App_A : CQE (Completion Queue Entry)
deactivate JFS_A

note right of App_A
    Write 完成后可从 JFC 轮询 CQE
    或通过 JFCE 收到事件通知
end note

== Read 操作 (远端 → 本地) ==
App_A -> JFS_A : urma_post_read()\nsrc=remote_seg, dst=local_buf
activate JFS_A
JFS_A -> Network : DMA Read Request\n(with remote UBVA)
Network -> SEG_B : DMA Read Request
SEG_B --> Network : Data Response
Network -> SEG_A : DMA Write\n(直接写入本地内存)
SEG_A --> Network : ACK
Network --> JFS_A : Completion
JFS_A --> App_A : CQE
deactivate JFS_A

note right of App_A
    Read 完成后，本地 buffer 已包含数据
    无需 CPU 拷贝
end note

@enduml
